title: 24 - Chords Instrument Swap

cover_description: The title text sits at the top, over a gameboy interface with a light blue background

cover: cover.jpg

-- synopsis
Chiptune where I used the same pattern for multiple instruments (i.e. on a square wave and a noise channel).

(Go back to the album Downloads for the Strudel code).
-- synopsis

--more
LSDJ lets you make a pattern for one instrument like the noise channel,
but then also lets you put it on any other instrument. Sometimes it's weird, but I thought it popped off this time (put the drum breakdown on the pulse channel). 
--more